Inspect keyed runtime threads and resolve uncertain unattended starts

Usage: instrukt sessions <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list           List this project's active and settled runtime threads, newest activity first
  resolve-start  Resolve a standing agent's start whose result never arrived: bind the session the
                 runtime did create, or declare that none was
  help           Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
